<title>USA: Pakistan seeks 200,000 T U.S. white wheat - agent.</title>
<headline>Pakistan seeks 200,000 T U.S. white wheat - agent.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan will tender for 200,000 tonnes U.S. grade 2 or better soft white wheat under the export credit guarantee program (GSM-102) for October 10-31 shipment, its U.S. export agent said.  </p>
<p>Bids must be received by September 29 at 1100 Pakistan standard time and will remain valid until 1800 PST September 30.</p>
<p>The wheat would be in bulk plus or minus five percent buyer's option.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
